#X text 20 20 The parameter takes the screen: its name at 8px \, its value and unit at 24px \, and the meters shrunk to the bottom strip., f 58;
#X obj 20 110 inlet;
#X obj 20 150 t b b b;
#X msg 20 220 2 0 8;
#X obj 20 270 list append;
